# Party banter: forestry policy, negotiated.
dialogue TSC_Banter_BurnTheDeadfall

== start ==
Maewyn: Not the standing wood. Burn the deadfall.

Madoc: The deadfall is BORING. It goes up like an apology.

Maewyn: Then burn it apologetically.

Madoc turns to the rest of the camp, delighted.

Madoc: She made a joke. The hills made a joke!

* [Leave them to it.] -> end
